# Notifications (MVP)

Channels:

1. **PWA push** (in-app + web push)
2. **Existing WhatsApp group** (team-configured webhook / integration)

## Triggers

| When | What |
|------|------|
| Match confirmed | Ask players to vote availability + carpool |
| Daily **12:00** & **21:00** IST until match day − 1 | If strength &lt; 11, remind to vote |
| Vote flips yes → no | Ask others if available |
| Match day − 1 at **18:00** IST | Squad + carpool summary |
| Sunday **19:00** IST | Weekend fee calculation + pay CTA |
| Daily **10:00** & **19:00** IST while unpaid | List of unpaid players |
| Admin edits frozen poll | Re-notify participation changes |
| Admin fund ask | ₹300 contribution request |

## Implementation notes

- Prefer scheduled jobs (Supabase Cron / Edge Functions) in **Asia/Kolkata**
- Persist notification rows for in-app inbox
- Never block core mutations if WhatsApp delivery fails — log and retry
